        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "158 Crumlin Road, Crumlin, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are proud to present new to the market for sale no.158 Crumlin Road. This fine 3 bedroom home comes to the market eagerly awaiting its lucky new owner to turn the key.\r\n\r\nNumber 158 benefits from fantastic local amenities to include many shops, cafes, restaurants, primary and secondary schools. As well as being in close proximity to areas such as Rialto and Kilmanham, which gives you many more options in terms of amenities.\r\n\r\nWalking through the front door you are met with a warm entrance hallway, a good sized front reception room is just off this. Moving through the property you have a second reception room alongside a fully fitted kitchen. This space has plenty of potential to be made into an airy and open plan living/dining area.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property you will find a sunny and private back garden which would make for a tranquil space for relaxing or entertaining family and friends. \r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises 3 bedrooms, a large double to the rear and a large double alongside a box bedroom to the front aspect. A bathroom alongside a toilet to the rear completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nCrumlin benefits from fantastic public transport links with many bus routes running right outside your door. The M50 motorway is only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.  \r\n\r\nThis property will be very popular so early viewing would be recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Prime location\r\n- Big back garden\r\n- Public transport links"
      },
      {
